  "notes": "Dividing work, costs, or responsibilities among multiple people so each bears a portion. Functions as a noun and する verb.\n\nWORD FORMATION:\n{分|ぶん} (divide) + {担|たん} (bear/carry)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {役割|やくわり}{分担|ぶんたん}: division of roles\n- {費用|ひよう}を{分担|ぶんたん}する: to share costs\n- {家事|かじ}を{分担|ぶんたん}する: to share housework\n- {分担|ぶんたん}{金|きん}: shared cost, contribution\n- {作業|さぎょう}を{分担|ぶんたん}する: to divide up tasks\n\nUSAGE:\nVery common in both workplace ({役割|やくわり}{分担|ぶんたん}) and household ({家事|かじ}{分担|ぶんたん}) contexts. Unlike {分配|ぶんぱい} (distribution of goods/money), {分担|ぶんたん} emphasizes sharing burdens or responsibilities.",
